tome haagenti;

//! haagenti — compression in pure Sigil (LARES-932; the spec is specs/sigil/SLICE-1-CODEC-DEFLATE.md).
//!
//!   invoke haagenti·core·{Error, CompressionLevel, Algorithm, Compressor, Decompressor, Codec};
//!   invoke haagenti·deflate·{GzipCodec, gzip_compress, gzip_decompress};
//!
//!   ≔ gz = gzip_compress(&bytes, CompressionLevel·Default)?;   // Result<Vec<u8>, Error>
//!   ≔ back = GzipCodec·new().decompress(&gz)?;
//!
//! Slice 1 is `core` (the error, levels and the Codec aspects) and `deflate` (RFC 1951 DEFLATE and
//! its zlib and gzip framings). Every compressed byte is Rust haagenti-deflate's (spec §5).

☉ scroll core;
☉ scroll deflate;
